{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Arise OS》把真實生活變成獵人奇幻小說中的升級系統，每日為你發出訓練、閱讀、寫作、編寫程式、音樂、運動與冥想等任務。無論是追求自律還是想以 RPG 方式記錄成長，都值得一試。App 原價 US $3.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>任務地城與屬性成長</h2>\n<p>App 透過每日指令建立習慣節奏，錯過一天可經 Redemption Arc 補救，並以計時地城鍛鍊專注力。完成任務會提升力量、智力等七項屬性，從 E-Rank 逐步晉升至 S-Rank，亦可參與每週 Hunt、公會與競技場。AI 每週產出 Chronicle 報告，記錄強項與需要改進的地方。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-323-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-324-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-325-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-326-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-327-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-328-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Arise OS</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T00:57:49.472762+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}